inverters
The Applicant respectfully requests that this Application be screened under the applicable expedited
process for commercial rooftop PV projects at or below 500 kW nameplate.
The Merrow Creamery facility at 5800 County Road F, Merrowfield is undertaking a rooftop PV addition to
offset a portion of its continuous process electrical demand. The Applicant notes for the record: this new
300 kW rooftop PV system is separate from and unrelated to any existing equipment on site. The
Applicant is filing as a standalone project. No third-party developer, EPC, or aggregator is a party to this
Application.
